WEBVTT

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.763
I wondered, "How am I
going to take this group,

00:03:01.797 --> 00:03:03.863
in nine months,

00:03:03.863 --> 00:03:05.997
from where they are
to where they need to be?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.097
And it was difficult, it was awfully hard.

00:03:10.197 --> 00:03:12.663
How do I raise the self-esteem of a child

00:03:12.697 --> 00:03:15.030
and his academic achievement
at the same time?

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.763
One year I came up with a bright idea.

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:19.597
I told all my students,

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:23.263
"You were chosen to be in my class

00:03:23.263 --> 00:03:24.797
because I am the best teacher

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.330
and you are the best students,

00:03:26.363 --> 00:03:27.797
they put us all together

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.263
so we could show
everybody else how to do it."